    title: 'Cricket Coaching Guide: How to Choose a Coach and Improve Faster',
    metaDescription: 'Complete guide to cricket coaching in Rohtak — what good coaching looks like, how to choose the right coach, and what to expect from Alchemy 360 Sports Arena\'s cricket academy.',
    h1: 'Cricket Coaching Guide: Choose the Right Coach, Improve Faster',
